sequenceDiagram
  participant S as JobSession
  participant D as Phone disk
  participant W as WorkManager
  participant U as UploadWorker
  participant B as Backend
  S->>D: cNN.jpg, cNN.ocr.json, session.json
  S->>W: kick (network required)
  Note over W: no signal: work waits
  W->>U: run when connected
  U->>D: read session.json + uploaded.txt
  loop each capture and note not in uploaded.txt
    U->>B: POST /captures or /notes
    alt new id
      B-->>U: 201 stored
    else id already stored
      B-->>U: 200 exists
    end
    U->>D: append id to uploaded.txt
  end
  alt any upload failed
    U-->>W: retry, linear 15 s backoff
  else STOPPED, all uploaded, not finalized
    U->>B: POST /jobs/{id}/finalize
    alt record built
      B-->>U: 200 job record
      U->>D: write finalized marker
    else extraction still running
      B-->>U: 503
      U-->>W: retry, linear 15 s backoff
    end
  end
  Note over S,B: offline drill: 6 items sent 6 s after signal, 0 lost, 0 duplicates
